OL,3,GNEWSARed route trial backed despite
OL,4,Adeath threat claim
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council has green-lit an 18-month
OL,7,Froad safety trial that would see all
OL,8,Fstopping and loading banned in part of
OL,9,FLuton, despite claims that people
OL,10,Finvolved in the plans had received
OL,11,Fdeath threats.
OL,13,FLabour's Alia Khan told a council
OL,14,Fmeeting there had been an "abhorrent
OL,15,Fsocial media campaign" against the red
OL,16,Froute proposals for Bury Park, which
OL,17,Fleft some feeling unsafe.
OL,19,FBut Luton Borough Council's executive
OL,20,Fbacked the plan despite a call-in by
OL,21,Fopposition councillors.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
